      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:42:42",
      "utterance": "あなたのご友人を思うお気持ちがすごく伝わってきます、、、",
      "tag": "Affirmation"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:42:54",
      "utterance": "ありがとうございます",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:43:25",
      "utterance": "大切に思ってらっしゃるのですね",
      "tag": "Paraphrase"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:43:35",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:43:56",
      "utterance": "もしも、あなたがご友人の立場として、",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:44:35",
      "utterance": "あなたが送った内容を受け取ったとしたらどのように思うと思いますか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:45:12",
      "utterance": "そうですね",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:45:43",
      "utterance": "気持ちを整理させる時間が欲しいです",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:45:54",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:46:56",
      "utterance": "失恋と友達から笑われたことで、深く傷つかれていることと思いますよね",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:47:22",
      "utterance": "はい そう思います",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:47:51",
      "utterance": "決して、あなたたちを責めているのではないことは理解してくださいね。",
      "tag": "Inform"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:48:05",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:48:11",
      "utterance": "コミュニケーションって",
      "tag": "Inform"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:48:32",
      "utterance": "人それぞれ考え方や価値観が違うので",
      "tag": "Inform"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:48:41",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:48:43",
      "utterance": "難しいですよね",
      "tag": "Reflection"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:48:51",
      "utterance": "そうですね",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:49:25",
      "utterance": "でも、きちんとあなたのお気持ちが伝われば、ご友人の方も理解してくれると思いますよ。",
      "tag": "Affirmation"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:49:48",
      "utterance": "そうだと良いのですが",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:50:31",
      "utterance": "「話そう」だけでは、あなたの思いは伝わらないかもしれないので",
      "tag": "Inform"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:50:48",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:52:18",
      "utterance": "あなたのご友人への思いも伝えた上で、気持ちが落ち着いたら「話さない？」とご提案するのはどうでしょうか？",
      "tag": "Suggest"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:52:41",
      "utterance": "そうですね",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:53:14",
      "utterance": "もしかしたら返信くるのに時間はかかってしまうかもしれません",
      "tag": "Inform"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:53:24",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:53:41",
      "utterance": "ですが、心配してくれて嬉しくない人はいないと思いますよ",
      "tag": "Affirmation"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:54:21",
      "utterance": "雰囲気を壊してしまったのは友人ですが、友人のことだけを考えたら可哀想なことだったので",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 3
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:54:31",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:55:23",
      "utterance": "ごめんねとは伝えた上で話そうよでした",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:55:57",
      "utterance": "待ってみます",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:56:31",
      "utterance": "そうでしたか。",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:56:36",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:56:45",
      "utterance": "お気持ち伝えてらっしゃったのですね",
      "tag": "Paraphrase"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-08T18:56:55",
      "utterance": "勇気がいることでしたよね",
